kubenfv.kubevim.common.v1.AffinityScope.description:
Scope of an affinity or anti-affinity constraint (IFA006 8.4.8.2). Which
values apply depends on the resource: compute uses NFVI_POP and NFVI_NODE;
ports add VIRTUAL_SWITCH_OR_ROUTER, PHYSICAL_NIC and PHYSICAL_NETWORK;
networks use PHYSICAL_NIC, PHYSICAL_NETWORK and NFVI_NODE.
